    "title": "Strangers help restore power to woman after she goes months without electricity - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jay McCully Gray News staff ,\n12 hours ago BOYCE, La. (KALB/Gray News) - A woman who spent weeks living without power or running water now has electricity again after her community came together to pay her overdue utility bill. Caroline Deville, a former paramedic who spent 28 years serving others, said the support has made an immediate difference... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
